WEBVTT

00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:16,740
I've been experiencing severe hot flashes at night, especially, along with all the other nasty

00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:22,020
metaposal symptoms. I saw that Christi Northrip has a product called a Rome

00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:33,540
abata made with an herb called mereria, verica. I can't pronounce that, sorry. Are you

00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:39,540
familiar with this herb? And if so, is it okay to take with hormone positive breast cancer?

00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:46,740
I am not taking black colhash or astro clear, only your other product with dim and calcium

00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:53,380
de-glutering. I am familiar with that herb, even though I can't pronounce it. And it has been

00:00:53,380 --> 00:01:01,060
used for people with hot flashes, and the reason why it can help is it can stimulate estrogen

00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:08,500
production in your adrenal glands. Now, if you have hormone positive breast cancer,

00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:14,180
that's not what you want to do. It would probably help with hot flashes,

00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:23,620
as well as black colhash can help with hot flashes. But the whole purpose of trying to

00:01:24,580 --> 00:01:30,980
the whole purpose of measuring whether you have a hormone positive cancer and trying to treat it

00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:41,300
as a help to reduce your cancer, is to reduce estrogens. And if you're taking something that will

00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:48,020
increase your estrogens, and thereby decrease the severity of the hot flashes, no matter how unpleasant

00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:54,420
they may be, you're kind of going against what you're trying to do for the breast cancer. So I guess

00:01:54,420 --> 00:02:02,500
I can't recommend that. You know, there may be other doctors that, no, estrogens have nothing to do

00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:08,340
on the care of your estrogen positive breast cancer. Estrogen, nothing to do with it. I know doctors who

00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:17,540
even give a prescription for hormone replacement therapy to people who have hormone positive cancer.

00:02:17,540 --> 00:02:25,140
To me, that makes no sense whatsoever. And I would never do that. So you're welcome to do what you

00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:32,580
want to do, but I wouldn't do anything that's going to increase your estrogens. And I never experience

00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:40,900
hot flashes. So I apologize for not taking into consideration the emotional issues with the hot

00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:44,260
flashes, but your whole purpose is try to slow the cancer.

